{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gothic Action Roguelike \u2014 Survive the Night of Souls</strong><br>A <strong>never-ending Halloween</strong> shrouds the land. Between flaming pumpkins, ancient gravestones and crimson rivers, waves of <strong>skulls, ghosts and witches</strong> never stop. <i>Light Fall</i> is an <strong>action roguelike/bullet-heaven</strong>: stack <strong>curses</strong>, craft <strong>broken synergies</strong>, wield <strong>cursed legendary weapons</strong>, and turn the graveyard into a fireworks of doom. <strong>No cheap jumpscares</strong> \u2014 this is <strong>gothic, supernatural, fast-paced</strong> combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halloween atmosphere</strong>: cursed graveyards, full moon, fog, blazing pumpkins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural enemies</strong>: <strong>skull</strong> hordes, <strong>ghosts</strong>, witches, demonic minibosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike action</strong>: short runs; perks, curses and wild builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary weapons</strong>: cursed relics that reshape your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No jump-scare spam</strong>: gothic tension, high-tempo battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Affinity System</strong><br>Bond with Nefemances to unlock weapons, abilities and team synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frenetic survival</strong> with escalating hordes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party progression</strong> and run-based synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Builds &amp; curses</strong> that wipe the screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themed Primordial bosses</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replayability</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Can you survive the Night of Souls and banish the Primordials before dawn?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3862610?t=1761669208","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862610/b4a2604073ce5e6cb2084c6f65c71d439cf3fff1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761669208","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862610/02ed7f159818eace663790179008b0aa461e65a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761669208","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862610/02ed7f159818eace663790179008b0aa461e65a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761669208","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains sexual innuendo, revealing clothing, adult language. Not recommended for minors."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3920790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gothic Action Roguelike \u2014 Survive the Night of Souls</strong><br>A <strong>never-ending Halloween</strong> shrouds the land. Between flaming pumpkins, ancient gravestones and crimson rivers, waves of <strong>skulls, ghosts and witches</strong> never stop. <i>Light Fall</i> is an <strong>action roguelike/bullet-heaven</strong>: stack <strong>curses</strong>, craft <strong>broken synergies</strong>, wield <strong>cursed legendary weapons</strong>, and turn the graveyard into a fireworks of doom. <strong>No cheap jumpscares</strong> \u2014 this is <strong>gothic, supernatural, fast-paced</strong> combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halloween atmosphere</strong>: cursed graveyards, full moon, fog, bla